{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "New Interests and Aspirations"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Looking to the Future"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Understand detailed descriptions of real or imaginary events and experiences in present, past or future and in spoken or written texts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le04ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Peter and Vanessa are talking about their future. "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use time clauses to give information about time and sequence in future actions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the words<span class=\"italic\"> once</span>, <span class=\"italic\">while</span>, <span class=\"italic\">as soon as</span>, <span class=\"italic\">until</span>,<span class=\"italic\"> If</span>, <span class=\"italic\">When</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Before and After </span>in time clauses. <br/> Future time clauses explain what needs to happen or which condition needs to be satisfied before a future event can occur."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the first conditional with these time clauses."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Structure:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul>As soon as/Until/If/When/Before/After + Subject + Simple Present tense, Subject + will/be going to + Simple Present tense"}, {"type": "text", "content": " <span class=\"strong\">Once</span> means at the same time. An action in the future will occur the moment the action introduced by the time clause finishes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:</br><ul><span class=\"italic\">Once you meet the right dude, you'll settle down.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": " <span class=\"strong\">While </span>means during the duration of a future action. The action introduced by the time clause will still be going on when another future action starts. You normally use <span class=\"italic\">while </span>after the main clause. <br/>  Example: <br/><ul> <span class=\"italic\">I'll be busy working at the restaurant while you have fun tonight.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">As soon as </span>means almost at the same time. An action in the future will occur immediately after the action introduced by the time clause finishes. <br/> Example: <br/> <ul><span class=\"italic\">I will not be ready for anything serious until I have my career where I want it to be.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Before </span>means at an earlier time. An action in the future needs to be completed before the action introduced by the time clause can occur. <br/> Example: <br/>  <ul><span class=\"italic\">Before I meet the right dude, I'll have my own bistro.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": " <span class=\"strong\">After </span>means at a later time. The action introduced by the time clause will lead to another action right after it is completed. <br/></br> Example: <br/><ul><span class=\"italic\">After you share your presentation, we will have a little celebration.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": " <span class=\"strong\">If</span> means on the condition that ..."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">If you meet someone who's worth it, you'll make it work.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When means at the time of doing something."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">When you meet that special someone, you'll know immediately.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Once you meet the right dude, you'll settle down and get hitched."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Before I meet the \u201cright dude\u201d, I'll have my own bistro up and running."}, {"type": "example", "content": "And as soon as that happens, you'll have no time to meet anyone."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Future Perfect Tense To express Certainty and Strong Opinion "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the Future Perfect to talk about something that will be finished by a certain time in the future. You can also express a strong opinion about a future event or express certainty with the Future Perfect."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use the <span class=\"underline\">Future Perfect</span>, you can sometimes think of the Future Perfect tense like the Present Perfect tense, but instead of your viewpoint being in the present, it is in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The Future Perfect is also used to express certainty of a future event being completed or to convey a strong opinion about a future event. <br/> You can use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">I'm sure </span>... or <span class=\"italic\">I really think </span>... to express certainty with the Future Perfect."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The Future Perfect has two forms: <br/><ul> <span class=\"italic\">will have</span> + <span class=\"italic\">past participle</span>, or  <br/> am/is/are + going to have + past participle"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:</br><ul><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">I'm sure I'll have met </span>someone by the time I'm twenty-eight.</span> <br/> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">I really think your career will have flourished </span>a few years from now.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "In our fifties we'll have had many conversations about our days of youth and a few chuckles about our self-doubt."}, {"type": "example", "content": " I think your career will have flourished."}, {"type": "example", "content": " I'm not sure I'll have met anyone by the time I'm thirty."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to get hitched"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to get married"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Once you meet the right dude, you'll settle down and get hitched. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you to talk about expectations in the future."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be in a rush"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to hurry"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I'm not in that much of a rush. I have some time."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be sure of oneself"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to feel certain"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You are so positive and sure of yourself."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to stand in one's own way"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make things hard for yourself"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You are only standing in your own way, Peter. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be on the same page"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to understand and agree with what is being done or suggested"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If you meet someone who is on the same page as you as far as their career is concerned, you will make it work! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to chuckle"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to laugh in a low or quiet voice"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: In our fifties we'll have had many conversations about our days of youth and a few chuckles.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "self-doubt"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the state of not believing in your capabilities"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: In our fifties we'll have had many conversations about our days of youth and a few chuckles about our self-doubt."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob10aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to flourish"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to bloom, grow and blossom"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I think your career will have flourished. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob10aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of an age you will be in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Tell a partner what you expect you will have acheived by that time."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue between you and your friend discussing what will happen and will have happened to you both in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the dialogue together and use clear pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I tell someone what I expect in my future by a specific period in time. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read the dialogue aloud with careful pronunciation."}]}], "labs": [{"type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"type": "audio", "title": "", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn10le04ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn10le04ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Once you meet the right dude, you'll settle down and get hitched.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Before I meet the \u201cright dude\u201d, I'll have my own bistro up and running.", "id": 1}, {"time": "10000", "image": "engenn10le04ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: And as soon as that happens, you'll have no time to meet anyone.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm not in that much of a rush. I'll be working hard over the next two years. I'm sure I'll have met someone by the time I am twenty-eight.That seems reasonable.", "id": 2}, {"time": "24000", "image": "engenn10le04ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm not sure I'll have met anyone by the time I'm thirty. You are so positive and sure of yourself.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: When you realize what a good guy you are, you will meet someone. You are only standing in your own way, Peter. By the time we are in our fifties we'll have had many conversations about our days of youth and a few chuckles about our self-doubt.", "id": 3}, {"time": "43600", "image": "engenn10le04ob10re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Maybe. I feel similarly to you, V. Until I have my career where I want it to be, I will not likely be ready for anything serious.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Never say never. If you meet someone who is on the same page as you as far as their career is concerned, you will make it work! A few years from now, I think your career will have flourished. If you want my honest opinion Peter, you should take the life-coaching course I did.", "id": 4}, {"time": "70000", "image": "engenn10le04ob10re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: So, with a bit more support you think I'll have reached my goals by the time I'm thirty five?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You already know the answer to that question.", "id": 5}], "audiosrc": "engenn10l